{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788284362-lgjV8badvKWaUDSlCN8C","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me start by understanding the task. I'm an independent evaluator for the S3 slice of PR #1850 / issue #1093 in the NetScript repo. I need to evaluate head `2398b9fe5` in the worktree `/home/agent/projects/netscript/worktrees/007-eval-1850`.\n\nThe task is to evaluate claims E1-E7, run gates, and write a verdict to `.llm/runs/fix-plugin-discovery-contribution-seam--0.0.7/impl-eval-verdict-s3.md`.\n\nLet me plan:\n\n1. First, read the harness skill and doctrine skill (mandatory per instructions).\n2. Look at the run dir artifacts (plan.md, worklog.md, evaluate.md from S2).\n3. Read the relevant code: the plugin core changes, the quality scanner rule, the guard test.\n4. Run the gates.\n5. Do the E1-E7 evaluations.\n6. Write the verdict.\n\nLet me start by invoking the harness skill and reading key files. Actually, the instructions say to invoke the skill via the Skill tool. Let me do that first, and also gather repo state in parallel.\n\nLet me start.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"GMICloud","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"87a74253-d0e6-4f02-8f0d-3fe28a0e7b40","uuid":"13077735-500c-40af-9535-0ca891a3611a","timestamp":"2026-09-01T17:39:34.741Z","request_id":"gen-1788284362-lgjV8badvKWaUDSlCN8C"}
