t | 0 | 265 processed, 0 findings/drops/refusals |\n250\t| official-plugin structured format | 0 | 265 processed, 0 findings |\n251\t| focused official-plugin adapter tests | 0 | 23 passed / 0 failed |\n252\t| quality scanner tests | 0 | 29 passed / 0 failed |\n253\t| `deno task arch:check` | 0 | no architecture/dependency gate failure |\n254\t| `deno task check:mcp-export-corpus` | 0 | canonical corpus current |\n255\t| full export doc-lint | 1 (contractual red) | 15 private refs / 0 missing JSDoc / 0 other; no increase |\n256\t| package JSR audit | 1 (contractual red) | 4 FAIL / 2 WARN / 1 INFO; exact non-increase |\n257\t| package publish dry-run | 0 | same two `unanalyzable-dynamic-import` warnings at `generated-project-registry.ts:69` and `manifest-resolver.ts:33` |\n258\t| scoped doctrine | 0 | 0 FAIL / 2 WARN / 1 INFO; no increase |\n259\t\n260\t### Ceiling and hygiene\n261\t\n262\tThe approved 12-path ceiling held exactly: three plugin adapters, their three tests, the extractor,\n263\tits walker test, the package README, the quality scanner and its test, and the regenerated MCP\n264\tcorpus. The two CLI no-argument consumers and `start-walker.ts` remained read-only. No manifest,\n265\t`packages/config`, dependency, or lock path moved. `deno.lock` remains byte-identical to\n266\t`origin/main`, SHA-256 `01ff3a232713a35e9bd5c9f34db7669568fadd16273cb9c82389832b10b55cbe`.\n267\t\n268\t## Supervisor verification at the integrated head (2026-09-01)\n269\t\n270\tMeasured independently of the implementation session, at merge `fe191a9f5`\n271\t(`origin/main` `82a2527e2` integrated).\n272\t\n273\t### Generated-carrier conflict resolved through its generator, not by hand\n274\t\n275\tMerging main conflicted on\n276\t`packages/mcp/src/infrastructure/export-surfaces/export-surface-corpus.generated.ts`, because #1862\n277\tregenerated the same carrier on `main` in parallel. Resolved per the standing rule — **regenerated\n278\tvia `gen:mcp-export-corpus`, never by picking a