{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_91c8fdfed8474bcbb56666b3","type":"tool_result","content":"=== README convention section ===\n+++ b/packages/plugin/README.md\n+## Extend SDK discovery\n+\n+Each plugin owns its discovery declaration. Its generated control-plane module exports the factory\n+name and registry axis that `AstExtractor` reads from the same files it already walks:\n+\n+```typescript\n+export const NETSCRIPT_CONTRIBUTION_BUILDERS = [\n+  { callee: 'defineChannelSync', axis: 'channel-syncs' },\n+] as const;\n+```\n+\n+External tooling can also add a plugin's contribution factory to one discovery run without changing\n+source files:\n+\n+```typescript\n+import { type AstExtractorOptions, startWalker } from '@netscript/plugin/sdk';\n+\n+const options = {\n+  additionalBuilders: [\n+    { callee: 'defineChannelSync', axis: 'channel-syncs' },\n+  ],\n+} satisfies AstExtractorOptions;\n+\n+const registries = await startWalker('.', options);\n+```\n+\n+Official plugins emit the same declaration during install or sync; plugin core contains no\n+plugin-specific factory table. Additional mappings are snapshotted per extractor instance.\n+Malformed identifiers, blank axes, duplicate callees, and a recognizable contribution factory call","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"87a74253-d0e6-4f02-8f0d-3fe28a0e7b40","uuid":"d1b19562-f90a-448f-9836-fcc6c950d1d6","timestamp":"2026-09-01T17:53:12.118Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== README convention section ===\n+++ b/packages/plugin/README.md\n+## Extend SDK discovery\n+\n+Each plugin owns its discovery declaration. Its generated control-plane module exports the factory\n+name and registry axis that `AstExtractor` reads from the same files it already walks:\n+\n+```typescript\n+export const NETSCRIPT_CONTRIBUTION_BUILDERS = [\n+  { callee: 'defineChannelSync', axis: 'channel-syncs' },\n+] as const;\n+```\n+\n+External tooling can also add a plugin's contribution factory to one discovery run without changing\n+source files:\n+\n+```typescript\n+import { type AstExtractorOptions, startWalker } from '@netscript/plugin/sdk';\n+\n+const options = {\n+  additionalBuilders: [\n+    { callee: 'defineChannelSync', axis: 'channel-syncs' },\n+  ],\n+} satisfies AstExtractorOptions;\n+\n+const registries = await startWalker('.', options);\n+```\n+\n+Official plugins emit the same declaration during install or sync; plugin core contains no\n+plugin-specific factory table. Additional mappings are snapshotted per extractor instance.\n+Malformed identifiers, blank axes, duplicate callees, and a recognizable contribution factory call","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
